					         	{
					             	alert(event.message);
					         	}

				             	jQuery('.period-summary-working-ind').hide();
								jQuery('.period-summary-ind').removeClass('working');
			         	}, 
			         	{escape: false, timeout: 60000}
			     	);				
				}				

function initialiseDRETracker()
{
    // store the original remaining effort as any change of task on the draft line
	// will need to revert back to this value as the basis

	autoDecDRETracker = {};

	jQuery.each(theGrid.Activities, function (i, act) {
		jQuery.each(Object.keys(act.Rows), function(i, key){
			var rowObject = act.Rows[key];
			if(rowObject.CanUpdate && rowObject.ActivityAssignmentId != null && rowObject.TaskId != null)
			{
			    var thisAss;
				for (var i=0;i<act.Assignments.length;i++)
				{
					var ass = act.Assignments[i];

					if(ass.ActivityAssignmentId == rowObject.ActivityAssignmentId)
					{
					    thisAss = ass;
					    break;
					}
				}

				if(thisAss != null)
				{
				    var thistask;

					for (var i=0;i<thisAss.Tasks.length;i++)
					{
						var task = thisAss.Tasks[i];

						if (task.Id == rowObject.TaskId)
						{
							thistask = task;
							break;
      					}
					}

					if (task != null)
					{
						var remainingEffort = ((task.RemainingEffort != null) ? task.RemainingEffort : 0);

						autoDecDRETracker[rowObject.Key + task.Id] = remainingEffort + rowObject.Total;
					}
				}
			}
		});
	});
}

function restoreTaskRemainingEffort(timesheetRow)
{
    var task = timesheetRow.getTask();

	if (task != null && task.CanEditRemainingEffort)
	{
		var ass =  timesheetRow.getAssignment();

		// having changed the value we now revert back to the current value + the total value of hours on this row already
		task.RemainingEffort = task.RemainingEffort + timesheetRow.Total;

		autoDecDRETracker[timesheetRow.Key + task.Id] = task.RemainingEffort;
	}
}

function decorateRowObject(activity, row)
{
	row.isAdjustmentRow = function()
	{
		return this.Key.substring(0,1) == '-';
	}
	
	row.setAssignment = function(newId)
	{
		var oldRateBand;
		var oldActivityId;
		var newActivityId;

		if (this.ActivityAssignmentId != null)
		{
			oldRateBand = this.getRateBand();
			oldActivityId = this.getAssignment().ActivityId;
		}

		this.ActivityAssignmentId = newId;

		var newActivityId = this.getAssignment().ActivityId;

		if (oldRateBand == null)
		{
			this.setAssignmentRate(this.getAssignment().RateBands[0].ActivityRateBandId);
		}
		else
		{
			this.setAssignmentRate(this.getDefaultRateBand(oldRateBand.ActivityRateBandId).ActivityRateBandId, oldRateBand);
		}

		if (oldActivityId != newActivityId) {
		    this.Cat1 = null;
			this.Cat2 = null;
			this.Cat3 = null;
			this.Cat4 = null;
			this.Cat5 = null;
			this.Cat6 = null;
			this.Reference = null;
  		}

		var ass = this.getAssignment();

		this.Status = 'Draft';
		this.DisplayStatus = 'Draft';
		this.StatusLabel = '{!UPPER($Label.TEStatusDraft)}';
		if (ass.CanActualise)
			this.RowType = 'Actual';
		else
			this.RowType = 'Forecast';

		//Raise event timesheet changed
		timesheetChanged(activity);
		
		return true;
	}
	
	row.setAssignmentRate = function (newId, oldRateBand)
	{
		// if period type changed
		this.ActivityRateBandId = newId;

		var newRateBand = this.getRateBand();
		
		var redraw = false;

		if (oldRateBand == null || oldRateBand.PeriodTypeEnum != newRateBand.PeriodTypeEnum)
		{
			redraw = true;

			this.Entries = {};
		}
		
		if (oldRateBand == null || oldRateBand.ShowRevenueUnits != newRateBand.ShowRevenueUnits)
		{
			redraw = true;
		}
		
		if (oldRateBand == null || oldRateBand.AllocationModeEnum != newRateBand.AllocationModeEnum)
		{
			redraw = true;
			
			// clear all
			this.Cat1 = null;
			this.Cat2 = null;
			this.Cat3 = null;
			this.Cat4 = null;
			this.Cat5 = null;
			this.Cat6 = null;
			this.Reference = null;
			
			if (newRateBand.AllocationModeEnum == 'Task' || newRateBand.AllocationModeEnum == 'CategoryAndTask')
			{
				var ass = this.getAssignment();
				
				if (ass.Tasks.length > 0) this.TaskId = ass.Tasks[0].Id;
			}
			else
			{
				this.TaskId = null;
			}
		}
		
		//Raise event timesheet changed
		timesheetChanged(activity);
		
		return redraw;
	}
	
	row.getAssignment = function()
	{
		for (var i=0;i<activity.Assignments.length;i++)
		{
			var ass = activity.Assignments[i];
				
			if(ass.ActivityAssignmentId == this.ActivityAssignmentId) return ass;
		}
		
		return null;
	}
	
	row.getRateBand = function()
	{
		var ass = this.getAssignment();
		
		if (ass == null) return null;
		
		for (var i=0;i<ass.RateBands.length;i++)
		{
			var rate = ass.RateBands[i];

			if (this.RowType == 'Forecast' && rate.Priority == 1 && rate.PeriodTypeEnum == 'BusDay') return rate;

			if(rate.ActivityRateBandId == this.ActivityRateBandId) return rate;
		}
		
		return null;
	}
	
	row.getAdjustmentRow = function()
	{
		var thisRow = this;
		
		var match = null;	
				
		//if another row exists with the same match key but key starts with '-'
		for (var i=0;i<theGrid.Activities.length;i++)
		{
			var activity = theGrid.Activities[i];
			jQuery.each(Object.keys(activity.Rows), function(i, key){
				var r = activity.Rows[key];
				
				if (r.Key != thisRow.Key && r.MatchKey == thisRow.MatchKey && r.Key.substring(0,1) == '-')
					match = r;
			});
		}
		
		return match;
	
	}
	
	row.findMatchingDraftRows = function()
	{
		var thisRow = this;
		
		var matches = new Array();	
				
		//if another row exists with the same match key but key starts with '-'
		for (var i=0;i<theGrid.Activities.length;i++)
		{
			var activity = theGrid.Activities[i];
			jQuery.each(Object.keys(activity.Rows), function(i, key){
				var r = activity.Rows[key];
				
				if (r.Key != thisRow.Key && r.MatchKey == thisRow.Key && r.Status == 'Draft' && !r.IsDeleted)
					matches.push(r);
			});
		}
		
		return matches;
	
	}
	
	row.findMatchingUnCompletedRows = function()
	{
		var thisRow = this;
		
		var matches = new Array();	
				
		//if another row exists with the same match key but key starts with '-'
		for (var i=0;i<theGrid.Activities.length;i++)
		{
			var activity = theGrid.Activities[i];
			jQuery.each(Object.keys(activity.Rows), function(i, key){
				var r = activity.Rows[key];
				
				if (r.Key != thisRow.Key && r.MatchKey == thisRow.MatchKey && r.Status != 'Draft' && r.Status != 'Rejected' && !r.IsDeleted)
					matches.push(r);
			});
		}
		
		return matches;
	
	}
	
	row.getDefaultRateBand = function(activityRateBandId)
	{
		var ass = this.getAssignment();
		
		if (ass == null) return null;
	
		var defaultRateBand;
	
		for (var i=0;i<ass.RateBands.length;i++)
		{
			var rate = ass.RateBands[i];
			
			if (i == 0) defaultRateBand = rate;
			
			if(rate.ActivityRateBandId == activityRateBandId) return rate;
		}
		
		return defaultRateBand;
	}
	
	row.getTask = function()
	{
		var ass = this.getAssignment();
		
		if (ass == null) return null;
		
		for (var i=0;i<ass.Tasks.length;i++)
		{
			var task = ass.Tasks[i];
			
			if (task.Id == this.TaskId) return task;
		}
		
		return null;
	}
}

